[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/dialogue/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"lane_kit"
text = "# DRAFT
# Kit selling candles at the abbey gate at dusk, nights 1 to 6. She notices the sacrist buying more and more (the crypt's candles; nothing here says so).
# Her own flags: lane_kit_<night> (talked to her tonight), lane_kit_n<night>_<topic> (asked); lane_kit_n4_look if he promises to look for the candles.
== start
-> start_known [if talked_n0_kit]
-> start_new

== start_known
Kit: Porter! You're still here. I bet Gib a farthing you'd run.
-> tonight

== start_new
(A girl with a tray of candles on a strap round her neck.)
Kit: Candles, porter? I'm Kit. Ralph the chandler's girl. I'm at your gate most dusks.
-> tonight

== again
-> back [if night=1] [if lane_kit_1]
-> back [if night=2] [if lane_kit_2]
-> back [if night=3] [if lane_kit_3]
-> back [if night=4] [if lane_kit_4]
-> back [if night=5] [if lane_kit_5]
-> back [if night=6] [if lane_kit_6]
-> hello

== hello
Kit: Porter!
-> tonight

== back
Kit: You again! You can't buy anything, can you. You're a monk.
-> ask

== tonight
-> n1 [if night=1]
-> n2 [if night=2]
-> n3 [if night=3]
-> n4 [if night=4]
-> n5 [if night=5]
-> n6 [if night=6]

== ask
-> n1_ask [if night=1]
-> n2_ask [if night=2]
-> n3_ask [if night=3]
-> n4_ask [if night=4]
-> n5_ask [if night=5]
-> n6_ask [if night=6]

# Night 1
== n1 [set lane_kit_1]
Kit: Well? What's it like in there? Did you see the finger? Is it real?
-> n1_ask

== n1_ask
* [if not lane_kit_n1_finger] Not yet. -> n1_notyet
* [if not lane_kit_n1_buyers] Who buys your candles? -> n1_buyers

== n1_notyet [set lane_kit_n1_finger]
Kit: Not yet! You live there. I'd have seen it the first morning. I'd have touched it.
-> n1_ask

== n1_buyers [set lane_kit_n1_buyers]
Kit: Brother Ranulf, mostly. He takes the whole tray most dusks now.
Kit: Father says they used to make one candle last a week over there.
-> n1_ask

# Night 2
== n2 [set lane_kit_2]
Kit: Brother Ranulf took the whole tray again at noon. I had to go back for more, just to have something to stand here with.
-> n2_pond [if died_merchant]
-> n2_ask

== n2_pond
Kit: Is it true about the man in your fishpond? Margery says he was in there all night with his eyes open.
-> n2_ask

== n2_ask
* [if not lane_kit_n2_what] What does he want with so many? -> n2_what

== n2_what [set lane_kit_n2_what]
Kit: I asked him. He said, for the saint.
Kit: The saint must be awful dark down there, to want all that.
-> n2_ask

# Night 3
== n3 [set lane_kit_3]
Kit: He wants them by the dozen now, Father says. Not by the pound. By the dozen, like eggs.
-> n3_tower [if died_warner]
-> n3_ask

== n3_tower
Kit: Did you really find him? The brother in the tower? Father says I'm not to ask you.
-> n3_ask

== n3_ask
* [if died_warner] [if not lane_kit_n3_tower] I did. -> n3_yes
* [if died_warner] [if not lane_kit_n3_tower] Your father's right. -> n3_hush
* [if not lane_kit_n3_dozen] What does your father make of it? -> n3_dozen

== n3_yes [set lane_kit_n3_tower]
(For once, she says nothing at all.)
Kit: Was he heavy? Sorry. I don't know why I asked that.
-> n3_ask

== n3_hush [set lane_kit_n3_tower]
Kit: He always is. It's very tiresome.
-> n3_ask

== n3_dozen [set lane_kit_n3_dozen]
Kit: He says it's good for trade and he doesn't like it. Both at once. That's Father.
-> n3_ask

# Night 4
== n4 [set lane_kit_4]
Kit: Eleven extra this week, Father says. On top of the usual. He writes it all down, he can't help it.
Kit: Where do they put them all? You'd know. You walk round in the night.
-> n4_ask

== n4_ask
* [if not lane_kit_n4_where] I don't know. -> n4_dunno
* [if not lane_kit_n4_where] I'll look. [set lane_kit_n4_look] -> n4_look

== n4_dunno [set lane_kit_n4_where]
Kit: A porter who doesn't know where the candles go. Father would laugh.
-> n4_ask

== n4_look [set lane_kit_n4_where]
Kit: You'll tell me? Promise. Not Father. Just me.
-> n4_ask

# Night 5
== n5 [set lane_kit_5]
Kit: Brother Ranulf didn't come for any candles today. First day since Michaelmas.
Kit: Father says they must have all they need, now. He said it funny.
-> n5_dead [if died_edwin]
-> n5_ask

== n5_dead
Kit: And Father says another brother's dead. He won't tell me which.
-> n5_ask

== n5_ask
* [if died_edwin] [if not lane_kit_n5_q] It was Edwin. -> n5_edwin
* [if not lane_kit_n5_q] Go home before dark, Kit. -> n5_home

== n5_edwin [set lane_kit_n5_q]
Kit: Edwin. I didn't know his name.
(She looks down at the tray.)
Kit: I should have asked him his name.
-> n5_ask

== n5_home [set lane_kit_n5_q]
Kit: I always go home before dark. You sound like Father.
-> n5_ask

# Night 6
== n6 [set lane_kit_6]
Kit: Father's shut the shop and he's on his knees. He never prays. Not even at Easter.
Kit: You'll be all right, won't you? Porter?
-> n6_ask

== n6_ask
* [if not lane_kit_n6_q] Go home, Kit. -> n6_home
* [if not lane_kit_n6_q] I'll be all right. -> n6_fine

== n6_home [set lane_kit_n6_q]
Kit: I'm going.
(She doesn't move.)
Kit: I'm going.
-> n6_ask

== n6_fine [set lane_kit_n6_q]
Kit: You're a terrible liar, porter. For a monk.
-> n6_ask

== leave
Kit: See you tomorrow, porter!
"
